{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.CechGerbe","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.CechGerbe","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction"],"declarations":41,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.exists_iso_lift_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.exists_iso_lift_iff","kind":"theorem","line":470,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L470-L512","doc":"**Theorem 4.17 (Yekutieli), cocycle model.** There is an object\n`η ∈ G_β(X)` with `H_β(X)(F η, g) ≠ ∅` iff `cl²_F(g) = 1`, provided sections of\n`𝒢` over each member `U i` of the cover lift to `𝓔` (`hsurj`, used only in the\nforward direction; it is the price of fixing the local objects in the cocycle\nmodel). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.cl2_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.cl2_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":462,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L462-L468","doc":"**Theorem 4.17, exact form, class level**: `g` is `F` of an object of\n`G_β(X)` iff `cl²_F(g) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.exists_lift_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.exists_lift_iff","kind":"theorem","line":411,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L411-L460","doc":"**Theorem 4.17, exact form, cochain level.** `g = π_* η` for an object\n`η ∈ G_β(X)` iff the obstruction is a coboundary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.cl2_indep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.cl2_indep","kind":"theorem","line":404,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L404-L409","doc":"The obstruction class does not depend on the local lift. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.cl2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.cl2","kind":"def","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L401-L402","doc":"The **obstruction class** `cl²_F(g) ∈ Ȟ²(U, 𝒜)` (Yekutieli Def 4.15). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction_lift_change","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction_lift_change","kind":"theorem","line":368,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L368-L399","doc":"**Independence of the local lift**: two local lifts give equivalent\nobstruction cocycles. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstructionCocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstructionCocycle","kind":"def","line":363,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L363-L366","doc":"The obstruction, packaged as a 2-cocycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction_cocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction_cocycle","kind":"theorem","line":352,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L352-L361","doc":"**The obstruction is a Čech 2-cocycle** (the lemma after Yekutieli's Construction, `lem:10` in the held LaTeX). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction_spec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction_spec","kind":"theorem","line":345,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L345-L350","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.obstruction","kind":"def","line":334,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L334-L343","doc":"**Yekutieli's Construction** in the cocycle model: the obstruction\n2-cochain of the object `g ∈ H_β(X)` relative to the local lift `ξ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.defect_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.defect_mem","kind":"theorem","line":328,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L328-L332","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.pushTw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.pushTw","kind":"def","line":314,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L314-L320","doc":"The functor `F = π_* : G_β → H_β` on objects. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.ζE_central","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.ζE_central","kind":"theorem","line":308,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L308-L308","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.fac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.fac","kind":"theorem","line":307,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L307-L307","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.ζG","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.ζG","kind":"def","line":306,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L306-L306","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.ζE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.ζE","kind":"def","line":305,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L305-L305","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.mk","kind":"ctor","line":303,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L303-L303","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.toPresheafCentralExtension","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension.toPresheafCentralExtension","kind":"def","line":303,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L303-L308","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.CentralGerbeExtension","kind":"structure","line":297,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L297-L308","doc":"A **central extension of gerbes** in the cocycle model (Yekutieli Def 3.21,\nrestricted to gerbes bound by `lien(𝒢)` with central twist): a central\nextension `1 → 𝒜 → 𝓔 → 𝒢` of presheaves of groups, together with a central\nlift `ζE : 𝒵 ⟶ 𝓔` of the twisting map `ζG : 𝒵 ⟶ 𝒢`. For a 2-cocycle `β` of\n`𝒵`, `G_β = TwistedCocycle ζE β`, `H_β = TwistedCocycle ζG β`, and `F = π_*`\n(`pushTw`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.retwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.retwist","kind":"def","line":265,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L265-L291","doc":"**Cohomologous twists give corresponding objects.** If `β' = β · ∂t` for a\n1-cochain `t` of `𝒵`, then `ζ(t) · g` is `β'`-twisted whenever `g` is\n`β`-twisted. (Equivalent banded gerbes have corresponding objects.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.ev_trans_of_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.ev_trans_of_rel","kind":"theorem","line":240,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L240-L263","doc":"**Isomorphisms preserve the twist.** If `g` is a `β`-twisted cocycle and\nthe cochain `g'` is isomorphic to it (Mathlib's `OneCohomologyRelation`: a\n0-cochain `h` with `h_i g_ij = g'_ij h_j`), then `g'` is `β`-twisted as well, so\nthe isomorphisms of the gerbe are the `OneCohomologyRelation`s. Needs `ζ`\ncentral. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.ev_trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.ev_trans","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L235-L235","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.mk","kind":"ctor","line":233,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L233-L233","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.toOneCochain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle.toOneCochain","kind":"def","line":233,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L233-L236","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwistedCocycle","kind":"structure","line":230,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L230-L236","doc":"A **`β`-twisted 1-cocycle** of `𝒢`: a global object, presented on the\ncover `U`, of the gerbe bound by `lien(𝒢)` whose twisting 2-cocycle is `β`\n(valued in `𝒵`, mapped to `𝒢` by `ζ`). For `β = 1` this is a `𝒢`-torsor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.class_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.class_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L208-L220","doc":"A class is trivial iff a representative is a coboundary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.class_eq_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.class_eq_iff","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L204-L206","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.instOneH2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.instOneH2","kind":"instance","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L201-L202","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.class","kind":"def","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L198-L199","doc":"The class of a 2-cocycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.H2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.H2","kind":"def","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L194-L196","doc":"Čech `H²` of `𝒜` on the family `U`: equivalence classes of banded gerbes in\nthe cocycle model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.equivalence_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.equivalence_rel","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L170-L185","doc":"For commutative `𝒜`, `Rel` is an equivalence relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.Rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.Rel","kind":"def","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L163-L168","doc":"Equivalence of banded gerbes on `U`: the cocycles differ by the coboundary\n`α_ij α_jk α_ik⁻¹` of a 1-cochain of `𝒜`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.one","kind":"def","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L157-L161","doc":"The trivial 2-cocycle (the trivial gerbe). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.cocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.cocycle","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L149-L149","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.mk","kind":"ctor","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L148-L148","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.toTwoCochain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle.toTwoCochain","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L148-L151","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.TwoCocycle","kind":"structure","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L146-L151","doc":"A Čech **2-cocycle** of a presheaf of groups `𝒜` on the family `U`: the\ncocycle data of a gerbe banded by `𝒜` (when `𝒜` is commutative). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_lift_change_tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_lift_change_tw","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L125-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_lift_back_tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_lift_back_tw","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L112-L123","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_lift_forward_tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_lift_forward_tw","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L97-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_cocycle_tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.CechGerbe.core_cocycle_tw","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechGerbe.lean#L75-L95","signatureChunk":0}]}